0.
Choose strain set for training (called training_strain_set.dat)
$ cp training_strain_set/training_strain_set.dat.41 training_strain_set.dat

1.
Create trajectory directories
$ bash 0_make_trajectories.bash


2.
If running in local desktop:
$ bash 1a_xxxx.bash
you need to set the for loop accordingly to the number of cores

If running on acuario:
$ sbatch 1b_xxxxx.bash
you need to set the slurm options, accordingly to the case (default set to fiber2)

